global qss ulong 100
global qsm ulong 100
global qsv ulong 100
global qsw ulong 100
global qst ulong 1
global qtkp ulong 1
global qtkl ulong 1
global qptab ulong QPT
note posting entries (rowpos, encoded position (col-1)<<31|offset) and the poslist arena
global qer uint QE
global qep uint QE
global qpa uint 8388608
global qpan ulong 1
global qpah ulong 1
note readers (by term for phrase matching, by phrase for NEAR)
global qrdi ulong QX
global qrde ulong QX
global qrdp long QX
global qlki ulong QX
global qlke ulong QX
global qlkp long QX
global qlkl long QX
global qlko ulong QX
global qlkc ulong QX
global qlkv long QX
