end
fn fts_inext t ulong to void
if ne get qxe t 0
ret
end
put qxs t get qxt t
fts_irun t
end
note sqlite3Fts5IterNextFrom: advance at least once, then until rowid >= x
fn fts_inextf t ulong x ulong to void
for a ulong 9
for j ulong 999999
