for a ulong 9
for j ulong 999999
if ge i c
ret
end
put qpa add d i get qpa add s i
i = add i 1
end
end
end
note ---------------- phrase matching (fts5ExprPhraseIsMatch) ----------------
note reader over term t's iterator data; false when empty
fn fts_rinit t ulong to bool
